  "solution_code": "def eng_uzyn_ospeli(a):\n    if len(a) == 0:\n        return 0\n    best = 1\n    cur = 1\n    for i in range(1, len(a)):\n        if a[i] > a[i - 1]:\n            cur = cur + 1\n        else:\n            cur = 1\n        if cur > best:\n            best = cur\n    return best\n",
